This directory contains the ANN distribution v1.1 (05/03/05) obtained from https://www.cs.umd.edu/~mount/ANN/
with minor R-specific modifications:

Error handler (ANN.cpp)
  - annError() prints with R's Rprintf instead of cerr. ANN.cpp also includes <R.h>.
  - The std::exit(1) call is commented out. ANN's fatal errors now print a message and no longer terminate the process, which R packages shouldn't do. 

Includes (ANN.cpp)
  - Added cstdlib and std::" and the file includes <cstdlib>. This is a compatibility fix for newer compilers.

Note: The querrying trees in the ANN library is not thread safe! Do not call it with OpenMP or RcppParallel. 

The original ANN readme is in ReadMe.txt 
